</figure>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A failure example of the absence of confidence-aware steering vector constraint. ‘w/o’ means without confidence-aware steering vector constraint, ‘w/’ means with confidence-aware steering vector constraint.</span></figcaption>
