</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Hyperparameters for PEFT Methods</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide the hyperparameters for the PEFT methods used in the experiments, including LoRA, IA3, Prompt Tuning, and P-Tuning v2. The hyperparameters are summarized in Table <a href="#A5.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ E.2 Hyperparameters for PEFT Methods ‣ Appendix E Experiment Implementation Details ‣ Distribution-Aligned Decoding for Efficient LLM Task Adaptation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="A5.T7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Hyperparameters for PEFT Methods. Here, <span id="A5.T7.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Prompt</span> means Prompt Tuning, <span id="A5.T7.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">P-T</span> means P-Tuning v2.</span></figcaption>
<div id="A5.T7.7" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:257.6pt;vertical-align:-126.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-20.8pt,15.5pt) scale(0.892497206150176,0.892497206150176) ;">
<table id="A5.T7.7.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A5.T7.7.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Parameter</td>
